{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"options":{"content":"","images":{},"widgets":{}},"type":"multiple"},"hints":[{"content":"Let's divide and then add to get $x$ by itself.","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}-4.5 \u0026= -0.5(x-7.1)\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n\\dfrac{-4.5 }{\\pink{-0.5}} \u0026= \\dfrac{-0.5(x-7.1)}{\\pink{-0.5}} ~~~~~~~\\text{divide each side by } \\pink{-0.5}\\\\\n\\\\\n\\dfrac{-4.5 }{\\pink{-0.5}}\u0026=\\dfrac{\\cancel{-0.5}\\left(x-7.1\\right)}{\\cancel{\\pink{-0.5}}}   \\\\\n\\\\\n\\dfrac{-4.5}{\\pink{-0.5}} \u0026= x-7.1\\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align} 9\u0026=x-7.1\\\\\n\\\\\n9 \\blue{+7.1}\u0026= x-7.1\\blue{+7.1}~~~~~~~\\blue{\\text{add }7.1} \\text{ to each side} \\text{ to get } x \\text{ by itself }\\\\\n\\\\\n9\\blue{+7.1}\u0026= x-\\cancel{ 7.1} {\\blue{+}\\cancel{\\blue{7.1}}}\\\\\n\\\\\n9\\blue{+7.1}\u0026=x\\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"The answer:\n\n\u003e $x=\\green{16.1}$\n\nLet's check to make sure.\n\n\u003e$\\begin{align}\n-4.5 \u0026= -0.5(x-7.1)  \\\\\\\\\n -4.5 \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}-0.5(\\green{16.1}-7.1) \\\\\\\\\n -4.5\u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -0.5(9) \\\\\\\\\n-4.5 \u0026= -4.5 ~~~~~~~~~~\\text{Yes!}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Solve for $x$.**\n\n$-4.5 = -0.5(x-7.1)$\n\n\n[[☃ numeric-input 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"numeric-input 1":{"graded":true,"options":{"answers":[{"maxError":null,"message":"","simplify":"optional","status":"correct","strict":false,"value":16.1}],"coefficient":false,"labelText":"","size":"normal"},"type":"numeric-input","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}}
